Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: candidate=1, seen=0.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.

